---
title: New project share · idle restart
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    classDef ok stroke-width:1.6px
    classDef wait stroke-width:1.6px
    classDef fail stroke-width:1.6px

    [*] --> status : root not shared
    state status <<choice>>
    status --> add : [pool stopped]
    status --> first : [running, provider live]
    status --> refused : [starting or stopping]
    state first <<choice>>
    first --> second : [idle, under lease]
    first --> refused : [in use]
    state second <<choice>>
    second --> stop : [still idle]
    second --> refused : [a start went live]
    stop --> add : guest stopped
    add --> boot : share journaled
    add --> refused : [booted meanwhile]
    boot --> [*]
    refused --> [*]

    note right of first
        Live run, pending recovery,
        open session or image build:
        in use. Unreadable: in use.
    end note
    note left of second
        Right before the guest stops,
        under the provider lease. Host
        releases follow it.
    end note
    note right of boot
        One line says so; this up
        then boots the pool.
    end note
    note left of refused
        Names up to three projects:
        down there, then up again.
        Nothing was released.
    end note

    class boot ok
    class stop wait
    class refused fail
